      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "YasuoPassive",
        "name": "浪客之道",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "亚索的暴击几率提升。此外，亚索在移动时会为一层护盾攒能。护盾会在他受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害时触发。",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">百折不屈：</span>亚索在移动的同时会积攒<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">剑意</span>——移动得越快，<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">剑意</span>的获取就越多。当<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">剑意</span>槽被充满时，在受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害的同时，亚索暂时获得<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(125 ~ 600)护盾值</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">向死而生：</span>亚索的暴击几率提升100%但他的暴击伤害降低至(100% Critical Strike Damage)。100%以上的暴击几率，会每1%转化为<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">?额外攻击力</span>。",
        "iconFile": "Yasuo_Passive.png",
        "cooldownSeconds": [],
        "range": [],
